  "_pbik": {
    "note": "Clean template (pbik templates harvest --clean): bindings, text, selections, images, names and per-member formatting removed; colours mapped to tokens via palette.json. Hand fix (2026-11-15, A-02): the eyebrow label uses textMuted at transparency 0, not text at 50%; a re-harvest undoes it."
  }
}
